sequenceDiagram
  participant LMS as Internal service (not in this repo)
  participant API as Portfolio routes
  participant DB as PostgreSQL (portfolios)
  actor E as Employer or anyone with the link
  LMS->>API: POST /v1/capstones/complete with x-internal-key
  Note over API: Constant-time key check, validate body
  API->>DB: INSERT, ON CONFLICT (learner_id, capstone_id) no-op, RETURNING row
  DB-->>API: new or existing row
  Note over API: Sign token v1.payload.HMAC-SHA256
  API-->>LMS: 201 portfolioUrl and verifyUrl
  E->>API: GET /v1/verify/token
  Note over API: Verify signature (current key, then previous key)
  alt bad signature
    API-->>E: 404 verified false
  else signature valid
    API->>DB: SELECT by portfolio id
    alt unknown id
      API-->>E: 404 verified false (identical response)
    else revoked
      API-->>E: 410 verified false, reason revoked
    else valid
      API-->>E: 200 displayName, capstoneId, issuedAt, skills
    end
  end
